# Maps commit identities to canonical ones for `git shortlog`, `git blame`, and
# `git log --use-mailmap`. It never rewrites history.
#
# Commits 5ee342fb..e6e8d7f1 and the 0.10.1 work were made offline with the
# placeholder identity `cgp-fork maintainer <maintainer@localhost>`. To credit
# them to a real identity, replace "Real Name <real-email@example.com>" with the
# maintainer's own name and email and remove the leading "# " from that line.
#
# Real Name <real-email@example.com> cgp-fork maintainer <maintainer@localhost>
